  <content>
    <section id="sect-00001">
      <title>Activity</title>
      <note class="link-to-learning" id="note-00001">
      <para id="para-00001">Access the <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b62c9150250bf52d6cc37569213ab516e0090dca">Desmos
        guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
        </note>

      <para id="para-00002">Below are three systems of equations you saw earlier.</para>
      <para id="para-00003">Use System A to answer questions 1 – 6.</para>
      <para id="para-00004">System A</para>
      <para id="para-00005">\(\left\{\begin{array}{c}4x+3y=10\;\\-4x+5y=6\end{array}\right.\)</para>
      <!--Q#1-->

      
